Package: qctool
Title: QC Tool (Beta): Quality Control of Darwin Core Datasets for EMODnet Biology
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person("Tobias", "Büring", email = "tobias.buring@vliz.be", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Checks Darwin Core Archives and simple tables against the EMODnet
    Biology / EurOBIS data standards (which include the OBIS and GBIF rules).
    Every issue points to a specific record. The rules (which checks run, how
    severe they are, which fields are required) live in an Excel workbook that
    the data management team can edit without changing the code.
